### Guidelines for Astro

- The web panel is an Astro static build with React islands (ADR 0016). The Hono server serves `apps/web/dist`.
- The browser talks only to the JSON API under `/api`. There are no Astro endpoints, no SSR and no Astro middleware.
- Use `.astro` files for layout and static content. Use React islands only for interactivity.
- Read environment values with `import.meta.env` at build time only. Put no secret in the web build.
